In the PDC MEASUREMENT INITIATION RESPONSE and PDC MEASUREMENT REPORT messages, the gNB-DU reports the PDC measurement results to the gNB-CU, where the gNB Rx-Tx Time Difference IE (specified in 9.3.1.170) contains the gNB Rx-Tx Time Difference Measurement/ Additional Path List/ Extended Additional Path List/ TRP TEG Information.

Whereas in the ASN.1 below, the rxTxTimeDiff is refering to GNBRxTxTimeDiffMeas. Hence for the gNB Rx-Tx Time Difference IE in the PDC measurement results, the ASN.1 is not aligned with the tabular. 

PDCMeasuredResults-Value ::= CHOICE {
	pDC-TADV-NR				PDC-TADV-NR,
	rxTxTimeDiff			GNBRxTxTimeDiffMeas,
	choice-extension		ProtocolIE-SingleContainer { { PDCMeasuredResults-Value-ExtIEs} }
}


In addition, in section 13.7 of TS38.133, the gNB Rx-Tx time difference measurement report mapping is defined in Table 13.7.1-1, where the measured quantity value can be mapped to a reported value up to 61565. Also in the TS 38.331, the RxTxTimeDiff-r17 is defined accordingly. Hence the IE type of the gNB Rx-Tx Time Difference IE in F1AP is not aligned with TS 38.133 and TS 38.331. 


